    "section": "9.9",
    "heading": "1: Choose Abilities",
    "lineStart": 13928,
    "lineEnd": 13938
  },
  "section": "9.9",
  "rulesText": "Choose three abilities that seem appropriate for the background:\n\nStrength or Dexterity. These abilities are ideal for a background involving physical exertion.\n\nConstitution. This ability is ideal for a background that involves endurance or long hours of activity.\n\nIntelligence or Wisdom. One or both abilities are ideal for a background that focuses on cerebral or spiritual matters.\n\nCharisma. This ability is ideal for a background that involves performance or social interaction."
}
